      "source": [
        "# Customer Segmentation using K-Means\n",
        "\n",
        "## Project Overview\n",
        "\n",
        "This project aims to segment customers based on their age, annual income, and spending score using the K-Means clustering algorithm.\n",
        "\n",
        "The project includes data exploration, preprocessing, feature scaling, cluster selection, model evaluation, PCA visualization, and business interpretation."
      ],
