    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 6. Feature Scaling\n",
        "\n",
        "The selected features have different numerical ranges. StandardScaler is used to standardize the features so that each feature contributes more fairly to the clustering process."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kbfWN7aGetA4"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n",
        "\n",
        "scaler = StandardScaler()\n",
        "\n",
        "X_scaled = scaler.fit_transform(features)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "xaujJ_Oz7ebW"
      },
      "execution_count": 21,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "X_scaled[:5]"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "JOgV-H4E7rTW",
