        "## 13. Business Insights\n",
        "\n",
        "The identified customer segments can be interpreted from both a customer behavior and business perspective. Each segment represents a different combination of age, annual income, and spending behavior."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OuX2X7yvgn2v"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cluster 3 — High-Value Customers\n",
        "\n",
        "Customers in this cluster have high annual income and high spending scores. They represent high-value customers and may be suitable for premium offers, loyalty programs, and personalized marketing campaigns."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "CNZHtRNCgruL"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cluster 2 — High Income / Low Spending\n",
        "\n",
        "Customers in this cluster have high annual income but relatively low spending scores. They represent an important business opportunity because they have purchasing capacity but are not spending heavily. Personalized offers and targeted campaigns could be used to increase engagement."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OCXmJvKQgtP0"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cluster 4 — Low Income / High Spending\n",
        "\n",
        "Customers in this cluster have relatively low annual income but high spending scores. Affordable promotions, loyalty rewards, and value-oriented offers could help maintain their engagement."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "rJokT6Gwgzgm"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cluster 5 — Low Income / Low Spending\n",
        "\n",
        "Customers in this cluster have both low annual income and low spending scores. Low-cost promotional strategies could be considered, while the company should evaluate the cost-effectiveness of targeting this segment."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "XjpvmRiTg1KH"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cluster 0 — Older Customers with Moderate Spending\n",
        "\n",
        "This segment contains relatively older customers with moderate income and spending levels. Marketing strategies could focus on customer retention, relevant products, and personalized communication."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7lnhBD5Ag7Qu"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Cluster 1 — Younger Customers with Moderate Spending\n",
        "\n",
        "This segment contains younger customers with moderate income and spending levels. Digital campaigns, personalized recommendations, and engagement-focused promotions could be effective for this group."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "62FffGhcg8yY"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 14. Conclusion\n",
        "\n",
        "K-Means clustering was successfully used to segment customers based on age, annual income, and spending score.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Elbow Method and Silhouette Score were used to select an appropriate number of clusters. Six customer segments were identified, with a final Silhouette Score of approximately 0.428.\n",
        "\n",
        "PCA was also used to visualize the clusters in a two-dimensional space, with the first two principal components explaining approximately 77.6% of the variance.\n",
        "\n",
        "The resulting segments provide useful business insights that can support targeted marketing strategies, customer retention, and personalized offers."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "NpxsG_F7hDrU"
      }
    }
